10. What is the one thing .hfz code should never do, to protect the mission and keep things legendary?

Never Obfuscate Intent.
The system's "magic" must come from its power and simplicity, not from being a mysterious black box. Every action taken by an AI, every piece of auto-generated code, every automated process must be instantly traceable, explainable, and understandable to a human. The moment a developer looks at the system and says, "I have no idea why it did that," the trust is broken. .hfz must always empower the creator, never hide from them.